@startuml assessment-service-class-diagram
title Level 3: Code - Class Diagram (assessment-service) - FR-04\nOwner: Ahmed Mohamed Ahmed
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classFontSize 12
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 55
skinparam ArrowColor #444444
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
  BackgroundColor<<component>> #D5EFE0
  BorderColor<<component>> #2E8B57
}
skinparam interface {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #555555
}
hide empty members

legend right
  |<#D5EFE0>   | Class of a component |
  |<#FFFFFF>   | Interface / domain class |
  | Solid arrow, open head | Uses (required interface / class) |
  | Dotted arrow, hollow head | Implements (provided interface) |
  | Filled diamond | Composition |
  | Plain line | Association |
endlegend

interface IAssessment <<provided>> {
  +AddAssignmentAsync(request): AssessmentResult<Assignment>
  +AddExamAsync(request): AssessmentResult<Exam>
  +SetAssignmentStatusAsync(assignmentId, status): AssessmentResult<Assignment>
  +SetExamReminderAsync(examId, daysBefore): AssessmentResult<Exam>
  +GetAssessmentsAsync(studentId, courseId): AssessmentSummary
  +GetAssignmentsByCourseAsync(courseId): IReadOnlyList<CourseAssignmentItem>
  +GetUpcomingExamsAsync(studentId): IReadOnlyList<Exam>
}

class AssessmentService <<component>> {
  -repository: IAssessmentRepository
  --
  +AddAssignmentAsync(...) / AddExamAsync(...)
  +SetAssignmentStatusAsync(...) / SetExamReminderAsync(...)
  +GetAssessmentsAsync(...) / GetAssignmentsByCourseAsync(...)
  +GetUpcomingExamsAsync(...)
}

interface IAssessmentRepository <<required - Database>> {
  +AddAssignmentAsync(assignment): Task
  +AddExamAsync(exam): Task
  +GetAssignmentAsync(assignmentId): Task<Assignment?>
  +GetExamAsync(examId): Task<Exam?>
  +GetAssignmentsAsync(studentId, courseId): Task<IReadOnlyList<Assignment>>
  +GetAssignmentsByCourseAsync(courseId): Task<IReadOnlyList<Assignment>>
  +GetExamsAsync(studentId, courseId): Task<IReadOnlyList<Exam>>
  +GetUpcomingExamsAsync(studentId, fromDate): Task<IReadOnlyList<Exam>>
  +SaveChangesAsync(): Task
}

class EfAssessmentRepository <<component>> {
  -context: AssessmentDbContext
  --
  +AddAssignmentAsync(...) / AddExamAsync(...)
  +GetAssignmentAsync(...) / GetExamAsync(...)
  +GetAssignmentsAsync(...) / GetAssignmentsByCourseAsync(...)
  +GetExamsAsync(...) / GetUpcomingExamsAsync(...)
  +SaveChangesAsync()
}

class AssessmentDbContext {
  +Assignments: DbSet<Assignment>
  +Exams: DbSet<Exam>
}

class Assignment {
  -assignmentId: String
  -courseId: String
  -studentId: String
  -title: String
  -description: String
  -dueDate: DateOnly
  -priority: String
  -status: AssignmentStatus
  --
  +isOverdue(): boolean
}
class Exam {
  -examId: String
  -courseId: String
  -studentId: String
  -title: String
  -examDate: DateOnly
  -examTime: TimeOnly
  -location: String
  -preparationReminderDays: int?
}
enum AssignmentStatus {
  NotStarted
  InProgress
  Completed
}

IAssessment <|.. AssessmentService
AssessmentService --> IAssessmentRepository
EfAssessmentRepository ..|> IAssessmentRepository
EfAssessmentRepository --> AssessmentDbContext
AssessmentDbContext --> Assignment
AssessmentDbContext --> Exam
Assignment --> AssignmentStatus
note bottom of AssessmentService
SOLID applied:
S - AssessmentService owns assignment/exam rules; EfAssessmentRepository persists.
O - new behaviour is added by new implementations, not by editing AssessmentService.
L - AssessmentService can replace any other IAssessment implementation.
I - IAssessment exposes only the operations its clients use.
D - AssessmentService depends on IAssessmentRepository, not on EfAssessmentRepository.
end note
@enduml
